{"resourceIdentifier":"4544","resourceName":"Al Multaqa Landfill Gas Recovery Project","description":"Al Multaqa Landfill Gas Recovery Project (hereafter referred to as “the proposed project”) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project developed by Oman Environmental Services Holding Company S.A.O.C (be’ah). The proposed project is located in the Al Mulqata Landfill of the Al Amerat city, Muscat Governorate, the Sultanate of Oman, and the landfill is the first engineered landfill in Oman which began its operations in early 2011. \r\nThe proposed project started operation in November 2021, and it is to capture LFG from the landfill and utilized the gas to generate electricity. At the time of requesting VCS registration, only cell 1 (half of the landfill) is closed and LFG from this cell has been captured and flared. After the closure and the installation of gas capture system of Cell 2 (the rest half of the landfill), gas engine(s) will be installed and fed with the LFG to generate electricity. The rated capacity of the engine is estimated to be 0.5MW.","location":{"latitude":23.339261,"longitude":58.449288},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-18","endExclusive":"2023-09-18","endInclusive":"2023-09-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4544"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muscat Governorate"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"OQ Trading Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"Muscat, Oman"},{"type":"string","value":"+968 9137 0000"},{"type":"string","value":"said.almaawali@oq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4544"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"121049"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31/05/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/11/2021 - 31/10/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95783&IDKEY=a8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0k132084757","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4544_07JUL2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-18T21:23:59.507Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93675&IDKEY=00e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9L129177825","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Al Multaqa-VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-10T14:30:26.66Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=113540&IDKEY=a8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n156571660","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-JointB PD_MR_AlB MultaqaB LandfillB project_publicB versionB 03_Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-05-31T11:31:41.707Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=103856&IDKEY=kq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha143217424","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Al Multaqa_Registration-Representation-Single-PP-v4.3.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-12-13T07:17:36.96Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=113542&IDKEY=fiofj09